# Generated artifacts are NOT enumerated here. The wrappers in ./bin pass the
# repo's own .gitignore files as additional --ignore-path entries (prettier 3.6
# accepts the flag repeatedly), so "gitignored => never formatted" holds by
# construction. That matters since #394: in write mode a generated file was
# silently rewritten on every push, in check mode it would BLOCK every push —
# a generated file must be able to do neither, and enumerating them reactively
# only re-arms the same failure the next time a tool writes somewhere new.
